Cell["\<\
Hand-transcribed per-signal test efficiencies (%) of the original picks at \
both operating points; kept in-notebook as the provenance record for the \
published tables -- do not regenerate them mechanically. 250 Hz arrays are \
percent values; the q99 arrays were transcribed as fractions and carry an \
explicit *100.\
