Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Plots", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0284d314-a880-4004-ac8a-c4585b9f8acc"],

Cell["\<\
CMS-style box plots of the same hand-transcribed arrays, one panel per \
architecture and operating point, exported as <model>_<tier>.{svg,pdf,jpeg}. \
The data cells below feed the single driver at the end; the model badge \
position is the only per-panel parameter (the SVDD badge sits lower at 250 Hz \
to clear the whiskers).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"21ff65c5-bbea-4ea7-86a0-7c15a9fbe0dd"],

